gin:0\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia, serif, Arial; font-size: 32px;\">Letters from Kali</span></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></th></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\" class=\"r0-o\" style=\"table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"r3-i\" style=\"padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 20px\"><table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><th width=\"100%\" style=\"font-weight: normal\" valign=\"top\" class=\"r4-c\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" class=\"r5-o\" style=\"table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\" class=\"r6-i\" style=\"padding-right: 15px; padding-left: 15px\"><table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"r7-c nl2go-default-textstyle\" align=\"left\" style=\"color:#653c56;font-family:Inter, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;word-break:break-word;text-align:left;padding-top:15px;padding-bottom:15px;valign:top\"><div><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"font-family: Georgia, serif, Arial; font-size: 32px;\">What is fear protecting?</span></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></th></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\" class=\"r0-o\" style=\"table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"r3-i\" style=\"padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 20px\"><table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><th width=\"100%\" style=\"font-weight: normal\" valign=\"top\" class=\"r4-c\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" class=\"r5-o\" style=\"table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\" class=\"r6-i\" style=\"padding-right: 15px; padding-left: 15px\"><table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"r7-c nl2go-default-textstyle\" align=\"left\" style=\"color:#653c56;font-family:Inter, Arial;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;word-break:break-word;text-align:left;padding-top:15px;padding-bottom:15px;valign:top\"><div><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(73, 64, 72);\">A strong feeling of “no” deserves attention.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(73, 64, 72);\">It may be responding to something happening now. It may also be connected to an old experience, an anticipated disappointment, or the discomfort of doing something unfamiliar.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(73, 64, 72);\">The useful question is: What is this fear responding to?</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(73, 64, 72);\">Take a page and write:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(73, 64, 72);\">I am afraid that…</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(73, 64, 72);\">Be specific. Continue with:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(73, 64, 72);\">What I know right now is…</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(73, 64, 72);\">Then ask:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(73, 64, 72);\">What would help me understand this better?</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(73, 64, 72);\">Perhaps you need information, a clearer boundary, more time, or a conversation. If there is a concrete risk, address it.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(73, 64, 72);\">There is no need to force yourself into a “yes” to prove that you trust your intuition. You also don’t have to treat every uncomfortable feeling as a final answer.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(73, 64, 72);\">You might be able to take a small, reversible step and see what you learn. You might decide to wait.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(73, 64, 72);\">Both can be thoughtful choices.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(73, 64, 72);\">What question would help you understand a fear you’re carrying today? You’re welcome to write back.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span style=\"color: rgb(73, 64, 72);\">Kali</span></p><p class=\"default\" style=\"margin:0\"><br></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></th></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" align=\"center\" class=\"r0-o\" style=\"table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\" class=\"r8-i\" style=\"background-color: #f5f0e8\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" align=\"center\" class=\"r0-o\" style=\"table-layout: fixed; width: 600px\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"r9-i\" style=\"color: #3b3f44; font-size: 16px; padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 20px\"><table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><th width=\"100%\" style=\"font-weight: normal\" valign=\"top\" class=\"r4-c\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" class=\"r5-o\" style=\"table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\" class=\"r10-i\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #3b3f44; padding-right: 15px; padding-left: 15px\"><table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"r11-c\" align=\"center\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"570\" align=\"center\" class=\"r0-o\" style=\"table-layout: fixed; width: 570px\"><tbody><tr><td